# The list of vouched (or actively denounced) users for this repository.
#
# Only vouched users may submit pull requests to this project. A denounced
# user is explicitly blocked from contributing.
#
# Syntax:
#  - One handle per line (without @). Sorted alphabetically.
#  - Optionally specify platform: `platform:username` (e.g. `github:jeremystretch`).
#  - To denounce a user, prefix with minus: `-username` or `-platform:username`.
#  - Optionally, add comments after a space following the handle.
#
# Maintainers can vouch for new contributors by commenting "!vouch" on a
# discussion by the author. Maintainers can also comment "!unvouch" to remove
# the author, or "!denounce" to denounce them. To target a different user,
# include their handle with an @ (e.g. "!denounce @username"); without the @,
# the word is treated as a reason and the discussion author is targeted.
#
# See https://github.com/mitchellh/vouch for details.

